</tr><tr>
<td width="64" valign="top" style="width:64px;padding:12px 0;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;white-space:nowrap;">15 Oct<br/><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#61667C;text-transform:uppercase;">Thu</span></td>
