    </td>
  </tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><img src="img/hero.png" alt="Xero and HitPay" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;border:0;" /></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 16px 24px;"><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 6px 0;">Who it's for</div><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Business owners looking to spend less time on manual invoicing and accounting, whether you already use Xero or are exploring it.</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 16px 24px;"><div style="font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2465DE;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 6px 0;">What you'll take away</div><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;"><tr>
