</tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><div style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Join HitPay Co-Founder &amp; CEO Aditya Haripurkar and Xero's Akshay Maheshwari. Attend live to connect with a Xero representative and access an exclusive Xero offer for webinar attendees.</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 24px 24px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#2465DE" style="background-color:#2465DE;border-radius:6px;"><a href="https://xero.zoom.us/webinar/register/1617900752258/WN_4Vozh-dBTXGkI3Xa46_L8w?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=october-events-2026&amp;utm_content=1-register-for-the-free-webinar" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;">Register for the free webinar →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
