</tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><div style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Join <a href="https://www.hitpayapp.com" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">HitPay</a> and <a href="https://osome.com" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">Osome</a> for a casual panel with the founders of <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elizabeth-loh-931653172/" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">Grow Connections</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/umaruddchia/" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">Oh My Strawberry</a>, followed by an open Q&amp;A and time to swap notes over drinks and snacks.</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 24px 24px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#2465DE" style="background-color:#2465DE;border-radius:6px;"><a href="https://luma.com/1a5w49x9?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=october-events-2026&amp;utm_content=2-save-my-spot" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;">Save my spot →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
