</tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 20px 24px;"><div style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Start with a real SMB pain point, like payment collection, invoicing, or reconciliation, and build on <a href="https://docs.hitpayapp.com/apis/overview?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=october-events-2026&amp;utm_content=5-hitpay-apis" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">HitPay's APIs</a> with a free sandbox account. Show how you used HitPay's <a href="https://docs.hitpayapp.com/apis/guide/ai-developer-tools?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=october-events-2026&amp;utm_content=6-ai-developer-tools" style="color:#2465DE;text-decoration:underline;">AI developer tools</a> to build it. <b style="color:#03102F;">Limited slots. Builders who submit a demo video are prioritised.</b></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 24px 24px 24px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#2465DE" style="background-color:#2465DE;border-radius:6px;"><a href="mailto:demonight@hit-pay.com?subject=Build%20Night%20demo" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Hauora, Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;">Submit your demo →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
